<%- include('../partials/head',{title:'FAQ'}) %><%- include('../partials/public-nav') %><main class="public-page"><section class="page-hero"><div class="public-container"><span class="eyebrow light">FAQ</span><h1>Common questions</h1></div></section><section class="public-section"><div class="public-container narrow faq-list"><details open><summary>How do I request a pickup?</summary><p>Create a customer account, choose Request Pickup, add the material, estimated weight and pickup location, then submit it for review.</p></details><details><summary>Is my estimated weight final?</summary><p>No. ReLoop keeps estimated weight separate from collector-recorded and final verified weight.</p></details><details><summary>Are collectors and partners automatically verified?</summary><p>No. Verification is manual until a real external verification provider is connected.</p></details><details><summary>Does ReLoop automatically confirm mobile-money payments?</summary><p>No. Payments stay pending until an external provider or authorized manual verification confirms them.</p></details><details><summary>Can I report a problem?</summary><p>Yes. Customers can open disputes and safety reports linked to their pickup, and ReLoop staff can review them.</p></details></div></section></main><% if(typeof entries!=='undefined'){ entries.forEach(e=>{ %><section class="public-section"><div class="public-container"><h2><%= e.title %></h2><p><%= e.body %></p></div></section><% }) } %><%- include('../partials/foot') %>
